# ── Test 10b: ae doctor orphan check (P2a — lifecycle blindness) ──────
# A session dir left behind after tmux dies (wind-down declared done but never
# `ae end`ed) is invisible to every --running-scoped sensor. doctor reads on-disk
# state, so it must surface the orphan by name. WARN, not FAIL — a stopped session
