# ── Test 11d: watchdog status/start/stop reject a stale RECYCLED pid ──────
# Root fix (beyond the doctor --refresh gate of 11b): _watchdog_is_running must
# require a live @ae_agent=_watchdog pane in its OWN session, not just a live pid.
# A stale .watchdog.pid pointing at a recycled, unrelated process must read as NOT
